  "notes": "TCL Smart TV Pro, UK firmware (device G09, product G09_4K_GB, Amlogic T5M), used in Brazil\nAndroid 12 (Google TV), firmware STT2.230203.001 AS24, 2 GB RAM\nSame firmware family as examples/tcl-g10-google-tv.\n\nApply:   TV_HOST=<tv ip> tools/disable.sh examples/tcl-g09-google-tv/debloat.txt\nUndo:    TV_HOST=<tv ip> tools/restore.sh examples/tcl-g09-google-tv/debloat.txt com.google.android.apps.tv.launcherx\nEverything is DISABLED, not uninstalled. Comment out any line you want to keep.\n\nStock launcher: com.google.android.apps.tv.launcherx. Live TV app: com.tcl.tv (also owns HDMI playback).\nKeep com.tcl.tvinput, com.tcl.suspension (Input/source menu), com.tcl.dashboard, com.tcl.autopair,\ncom.tcl.systemserver (mic hotkeys) and com.tcl.providers.config. com.tcl.initsetup is in the list\nbelow (it also owns channel installation) - comment it out if you still need to scan channels.\nFirmware updates come through Play Services (gms SystemUpdatePanoActivity); there is no TCL OTA package.\nTCL telemetry and analytics",
